            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>Rear underfloor structure (2) for a motor vehicle (1) comprising a first and a second side member (4) and at least one cross member (5) linking said first and second side members (4), wherein said rear underfloor structure (2) is made by stamping a single tailor welded blank (26) comprising at least two sub-blanks.</p>
